    <string name="onboarding_vault_body">Tick the apps that eat your time. Common ones are already ticked, and their websites go in the Vault with them. You can add more later in Settings, at once; taking one out waits 24 hours.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_budget_body">How many minutes a day, across all Vault apps together? You can lower it at any time. Raising it later waits 24 hours.</string>
